    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits implication by courts";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) Without limiting the generality of subsection (1), an order made by a magistrate under section 3ZI, 3ZJ, 3ZK, 3ZN or 3ZQZB has effect only by virtue of this Act and is not to be taken by implication to be made by a court.";
