    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Permission to extend time period";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) If:  (a) a warrant in relation to premises is being executed; and  (b) there is an emergency situation; and  (c) the executing officer or a constable assisting believes on reasonable grounds that the executing officer and the constables assisting will not be able to return to the premises within the 12 hour period mentioned in paragraph 3J(2)(aa); he or she may apply to an issuing officer for an extension of that period.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) If:  (a) a warrant in relation to premises is being executed; and  (b) there is an emergency situation; and  (c) the executing officer or a constable assisting believes on reasonable grounds that the executing officer and the constables assisting will not be able to return to the premises within the 12 hour period mentioned in paragraph 3J(2)(aa); he or she may apply to an issuing officer for an extension of that period.";
