    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "If offender not liable, then Commonwealth offence cannot be committed.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(not (offender liable to Commonwealth law)) -> (not (Commonwealth offence committed))";
